; HIRAKU's ezusb.dll for the C33 cabinet (ezusb_c33.c): Konami's C33 I/O board's exports, by their plain C names,
; then its video board's (Konami's ezusb_video.dll), which HIRAKU's ezusb_video.dll forwards here (ezusb_video_c33.def)
